{"segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 3.54, "text": "In this town, the ice cream truck only comes at midnight."}, {"start": 4.02, "end": 6.06, "text": "And every kid knows three rules."}, {"start": 6.74, "end": 9.16, "text": "Rule number one, never buy its ice cream."}, {"start": 9.64, "end": 12.2, "text": "Rule number two, never follow its music."}, {"start": 12.64, "end": 15.86, "text": "And rule number three, if the truck stops outside your house,"}, {"start": 16.34, "end": 17.7, "text": "never look out the window."}, {"start": 18.04, "end": 21.08, "text": "Because every kid who broke these rules has disappeared."}, {"start": 21.76, "end": 22.8, "text": "My name is Mason."}, {"start": 23.16, "end": 25.28, "text": "And last night, I broke all three."}, {"start": 25.8, "end": 27.58, "text": "It started at exactly midnight."}, {"start": 27.58, "end": 30.3, "text": "I heard a creepy ice cream melody outside."}, {"start": 31.0, "end": 31.96, "text": "I peeked through my curtains."}, {"start": 32.66, "end": 35.32, "text": "A bright pink ice cream truck was parked across the street."}, {"start": 35.76, "end": 37.06, "text": "But there was nobody driving."}, {"start": 37.8, "end": 39.0, "text": "Suddenly, my phone rang."}, {"start": 39.44, "end": 40.68, "text": "It was my best friend, Oliver."}, {"start": 41.36, "end": 43.48, "text": "Mason, my little brother followed the truck."}, {"start": 43.8, "end": 44.4, "text": "He's gone."}, {"start": 45.02, "end": 46.28, "text": "Then the call cut off."}, {"start": 46.7, "end": 48.7, "text": "I grabbed my flashlight and ran outside."}, {"start": 49.26, "end": 50.92, "text": "The truck was waiting at the end of the street."}, {"start": 51.38, "end": 52.94, "text": "Its window slowly opened."}, {"start": 53.42, "end": 55.22, "text": "A tall ice cream man leaned out."}, {"start": 55.56, "end": 56.72, "text": "Free ice cream, Mason."}, {"start": 56.72, "end": 59.04, "text": "He handed me a pink ice cream cone."}, {"start": 59.52, "end": 60.04, "text": "I took it."}, {"start": 60.38, "end": 62.46, "text": "And suddenly, the back door swung open."}, {"start": 62.92, "end": 64.78, "text": "I heard Oliver screaming from inside."}, {"start": 65.28, "end": 65.96, "text": "Help me."}, {"start": 66.38, "end": 67.5, "text": "I ran into the truck."}, {"start": 67.78, "end": 69.44, "text": "But the inside was impossible."}, {"start": 69.98, "end": 71.98, "text": "It was an endless ice cream shop."}, {"start": 72.52, "end": 76.0, "text": "Hundreds of missing children stood frozen holding ice cream cones."}, {"start": 76.46, "end": 79.1, "text": "And there was Oliver trapped behind a glass wall."}, {"start": 79.72, "end": 81.5, "text": "Mason, don't eat the ice cream."}, {"start": 82.04, "end": 84.44, "text": "Suddenly, the ice cream man appeared behind me."}, {"start": 84.44, "end": 87.68, "text": "Once you take a bite, you stay forever."}, {"start": 88.42, "end": 89.14, "text": "I dropped the cone."}, {"start": 89.64, "end": 91.3, "text": "Then I noticed something strange."}, {"start": 91.88, "end": 94.76, "text": "Every time the music played, the children glowed pink."}, {"start": 95.24, "end": 97.62, "text": "And when the melody paused, the glow disappeared."}, {"start": 98.16, "end": 99.88, "text": "The music was keeping them trapped."}, {"start": 100.4, "end": 102.64, "text": "I spotted an old music box behind the counter."}, {"start": 103.02, "end": 105.04, "text": "I grabbed a metal chair and smashed it."}, {"start": 105.34, "end": 106.46, "text": "The music stopped."}, {"start": 107.0, "end": 108.42, "text": "Every glass wall shattered."}, {"start": 108.92, "end": 110.56, "text": "The children started moving again."}, {"start": 111.1, "end": 112.16, "text": "Everyone, run!"}, {"start": 112.16, "end": 116.22, "text": "We raced toward the exit as the entire shop collapsed around us."}, {"start": 116.64, "end": 119.38, "text": "The ice cream man screamed, you can't escape."}, {"start": 119.98, "end": 121.84, "text": "But we jumped outside just in time."}, {"start": 122.26, "end": 124.04, "text": "The truck vanished into thin air."}, {"start": 124.56, "end": 125.78, "text": "Oliver hugged his little brother."}, {"start": 126.12, "end": 130.3, "text": "And for the first time in years, every missing child was finally home."}, {"start": 130.76, "end": 134.02, "text": "I thought it was over until the next night."}, {"start": 134.42, "end": 139.72, "text": "At exactly 11.59 p.m., a small pink ice cream box appeared on my doorstep."}, {"start": 140.34, "end": 141.52, "text": "Inside was a note."}, {"start": 141.52, "end": 143.72, "text": "Thank you for freeing them, Mason."}, {"start": 144.36, "end": 147.08, "text": "And underneath, but who's going to free me?"}], "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.2}, {"w": "this", "s": 0.2, "e": 0.42}, {"w": "town,", "s": 0.42, "e": 0.78}, {"w": "the", "s": 1.14, "e": 1.16}, {"w": "ice", "s": 1.16, "e": 1.4}, {"w": "cream", "s": 1.4, "e": 1.66}, {"w": "truck", "s": 1.66, "e": 1.96}, {"w": "only", "s": 1.96, "e": 2.34}, {"w": "comes", "s": 2.34, "e": 2.76}, {"w": "at", "s": 2.76, "e": 3.04}, {"w": "midnight.", "s": 3.04, "e": 3.54}, {"w": "And", "s": 4.02, "e": 4.12}, {"w": "every", "s": 4.12, "e": 4.52}, {"w": "kid", "s": 4.52, "e": 4.78}, {"w": "knows", "s": 4.78, "e": 5.1}, {"w": "three", "s": 5.1, "e": 5.52}, {"w": "rules.", "s": 5.52, "e": 6.06}, {"w": "Rule", "s": 6.74, "e": 6.74}, {"w": "number", "s": 6.74, "e": 6.96}, {"w": "one,", "s": 6.96, "e": 7.38}, {"w": "never", "s": 7.9, "e": 8.04}, {"w": "buy", "s": 8.04, "e": 8.5}, {"w": "its", "s": 8.5, "e": 8.68}, {"w": "ice", "s": 8.68, "e": 8.88}, {"w": "cream.", "s": 8.88, "e": 9.16}, {"w": "Rule", "s": 9.64, "e": 9.78}, {"w": "number", "s": 9.78, "e": 10.0}, {"w": "two,", "s": 10.0, "e": 10.34}, {"w": "never", "s": 10.92, "e": 11.12}, {"w": "follow", "s": 11.12, "e": 11.58}, {"w": "its", "s": 11.58, "e": 11.82}, {"w": "music.", "s": 11.82, "e": 12.2}, {"w": "And", "s": 12.64